---
Keep folders in the shape you declared.

Usage: tungstate <COMMAND>

Commands:
  folder  Manage governed folders
  link    Manage transfer links between folders
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
